[2]: https://github.com/git/git/commit/a3e5bad734f8f83a485c5f28535d1f409993a175
[3]: https://github.com/git/git/blob/6de20f6092dcf9bdb1c8efe03db4b70c82b423dd/commit-reach.c#L82-L180

